				playerBusy[id] = true
				busy[id] = true
			}
		}
		// A directed deed on an NPC this turn (a gift, a blow, a sale) claims that
		// NPC just like a conversation partner: the player engaged them, so they
		// leave background chatter and their turn voice is the reaction to the
		// player — not idle talk with a neighbour. Generalizes conversation
		// exclusivity to non-talk addressed actions (finding #24).
		for _, id := range claimedByPlayer(ctx, p.eventStore, worldID, player.ID, gameTime.Tick) {
